  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["5. Exterior covariant derivative", "Section", 
      CellID -> 1100274], Cell[TextData[{"The exterior covariant derivative \
is a graded differentiation and it is defined from any covariant derivative. \
The way in which this is done in ", StyleBox["xTerior", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Code Pro"], 
        " is by adding a second argument to the exterior derivative ", 
        StyleBox["Diff", FontFamily -> "Source Code Pro"], ", indicating the \
covariant derivative which one uses to define the exterior covariant \
derivative."}], "Text", CellID -> 1100275], 
